      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="1406" data-end="1458">Centralize and make the most of your donor database.</p><ul data-start="1460" data-end="1594"><li data-start="1460" data-end="1498">Complete donation history by donor</li><li data-start="1499" data-end="1549">Segmentation by profile, amount, and frequency</li><li data-start="1550" data-end="1594">Automated follow-ups and pledge tracking</li></ul>
    - logo: crm-sales
      heading: Fundraising & Campaigns
      descriptionPoints: <p data-start="1629" data-end="1682">Manage your fundraising campaigns from a single tool.</p><ul data-start="1684" data-end="1817"><li data-start="1684" data-end="1730">Online donation forms connected to the ERP</li><li data-start="1731" data-end="1776">Targeted email campaigns by donor segment</li><li data-start="1777" data-end="1817">Automatic generation of tax receipts</li></ul>
    - logo: analytique
      heading: Grant Management
      descriptionPoints: '<p data-start="1845" data-end="1893">Manage each grant from award to final reporting.</p><ul data-start="1895" data-end="2067"><li data-start="1895" data-end="1951">Tracking of milestones and conditions for each grant</li><li data-start="1952" data-end="2008">Alerts for reporting deadlines and payment schedules</li><li data-start="2009" data-end="2067">Custom reports by funder: EU, USAID, foundations, etc.</li></ul>'
